      563.23
    ],
    "text": "The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Colombo to Pottuvil via Galle and Matara. There is a possibility that near shore sea areas off the coast extending from Beruwala to Matara via Galle, may experience surges due to swell waves.",
